;| ; A document whose one anchor is an INLINE `.mid` — the shape every bound
;| ; SMF operation is exercised against (plan 07, "Bound content,
;| ; precisely"). The anchor carries its dump, so no file is read and the
;| ; case is one text.
;| ;
;| ; One track at 480 PPQ with three notes on channel 1 and a controller the
;| ; `filter` lane reads: a note whose neighbours leave it room to move in
;| ; place, one that has to cross the controller to reach its destination,
;| ; and two `(control-change …)` events so a curve lane has steps of its
;| ; own. `spare` is native and empty, which is what a `bind` needs.
